"""Connect Claude Code to the company's data connectors AS YOURSELF.

The MCP server `fiszu` (https://claude.fiszu.com/connectors/mcp) reads company systems with
YOUR Keycloak identity: it shows only the tools your groups grant, and refuses you on the next
call once your account is disabled. This helper holds your sign-in and hands Claude Code a
fresh bearer on demand — it holds no company secret (`ai-connectors-cli` is a public client).

Plan: internal-knowledge-base/plans/2026-10-04_ai-connector-platform.md §2.2, §6.3.
"""
